/P 88 0 R
/E (There are some institutional differences within New Zealand. Auckland provides the strongest perceived entrepreneurship climate and the greatest exposure to entrepreneurship education. Waikato reports higher rates of nascent and active entrepreneurship in this sample. Victoria contributes the largest sample but records lower rates of nascent and active entrepreneurship.)
